  "_about": [
    "Product catalogue, Pakistan. FR-REC-005, DR-005, DR-006.",
    "",
    "Every product here is sold in Pakistan through pharmacies or the main",
    "online retailers. The pharmacy actives (benzoyl peroxide, azelaic acid,",
    "adapalene) were checked against drugsinfo.pk, Pakistan's drug registry,",
    "which lists them as over the counter.",
    "",
    "WHAT IS NOT VERIFIED HERE. Stock and price move constantly and neither is",
    "stored in this file -- the app shows a BUDGET/PREMIUM tier, never a figure,",
    "so a stale price cannot reach a user. Before release someone should confirm",
    "each line is actually buyable locally, and that online listings are genuine",
    "rather than grey-market.",
    "",
    "SINGLE ACTIVE PER PRODUCT. The matching filter rejects any product carrying",
    "a second matrix active, because it would break the active-count limit the",
    "engine just enforced (FR-REC-004). That rules out the common Pakistani",
    "adapalene generics, which are sold combined with benzoyl peroxide.",
    "",
    "TWO PRODUCTS ARE LISTED BUT CANNOT CURRENTLY BE SHOWN:",
    "  Skinoren 20% -- the strength NICE and the AAD actually evidence, and the",
    "    cheapest azelaic option locally, but above the matrix cap of 10%.",
    "  The Ordinary Niacinamide 10% -- above every niacinamide rule's cap of 5%.",
    "Both are kept so the conflict is visible in the data. Raising either cap is",
    "a clinical decision and belongs to the dermatologist review, not to this file."
